{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4e1ca1c7917ef4f0e446e310be32c1ab8c22bbebf870411957ca036b9d3a563b", "ja": "（仕事の一環で、杏奈がメイドカフェで\n一日店員体験をすることになった）", "zh": "（作为工作的一环，杏奈要在女仆咖啡厅体验一天的店员工作。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "13dea8125588ed0a9b2601fa38594f246aee80b4388a2df42768f93b2a915848", "ja": "行ってらっしゃいませ、ご主人さま、お嬢さま！\nまたのお越しをお待ちしています♪", "zh": "欢迎回来，主人大人，小姐大人！\n期待您的再次光临♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1002_null", "source_sha256": "a35878f3fc0f116d6f91599d4c68ce0ebb894f4d3005c569bd1940f788b18654", "ja": "……あ、あの、杏奈ちゃん！　もしよかったら、\n一緒に写真、撮ってくれませんか！？", "zh": "……那个，杏奈！如果可以的话，\n能跟我一起拍张照片吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "39fc62f6d97700d77cfa907d6675300d792dea895258b4f3d62e8c2cd2b184fa", "ja": "あっ、はい！　もちろん大丈夫ですよ♪\n今行きますね！", "zh": "啊，好的！当然可以哦♪\n我现在就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1004_p", "source_sha256": "850fbce22a16e01f918971d7278e9400d6d926bc3c9fe2eff6cc99bcd9da32bc", "ja": "お疲れさま、杏奈。接客だけじゃなくて、\n写真対応までしてくれたんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。不只是接待工作，连拍照也帮忙应对了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "eeff0a1a05d59408d913018f6c49b278493d9be32a44e5740bd8f0fc6f0acea4", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん……。\nうん……撮りたいって、言ってもらえた、から……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……。\n嗯……因为对方说想拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1006_p", "source_sha256": "595a3bf69221d82198035d1532ed23e728cc78a1e0fc2f96480af5c4f42e70d0", "ja": "自然に応対してくれて、助かったよ。\n頑張ってくれて、ありがとな。", "zh": "你能自然地应对，真是帮了大忙。谢谢你这么努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "66287a495a972229eacaaf7bcc3ce2637e1f0caedfd682d4d32ea21b31c99581", "ja": "ん……。杏奈も、楽しかった、から……。\nよろこんで、もらえて……杏奈も、うれしい……。", "zh": "嗯……因为杏奈也，很开心……\n能让大家感到高兴……杏奈也，很高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "656cc7124185e683594692e7b74dc56dc6f3b98f42340a38a5a87b98455d75b4", "ja": "でも……えと……写真、杏奈と一緒で、\nいいのかなって……ちょっと、気になってた……。", "zh": "不过……那个……照片里和杏奈一起，真的可以吗……杏奈之前……有点在意这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "dc85a8368d9a5d1809ce975de6656d7ba64304d0b212e1aa7f7a075ade37418e", "ja": "杏奈、一日店員、だから……。\nメイドとしては……あんまり、うまくないし……。", "zh": "因为杏奈只是一天店员……所以……作为女仆……不太擅长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "0887ec4752d727da1d5dcb36c424d778905922c5b96aecf0fdff1605929ffadb", "ja": "それに……杏奈は、次、来てくれたときには、\nいないから……いいのかな。って……。", "zh": "而且……下次你来的时候，杏奈已经不在了……这样，真的好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b32a84b4a7d8c4fbf144529dee32097bd42241154b15a8aef4afd3bb46ade7bd", "ja": "まあ、そこは気にすることないと思うけど。\n今日だけのレアキャラってことで。", "zh": "不过，我觉得你不用在意这个。就当作是只在今天出现的稀有角色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "47d6eb3a6da288dae43aeefd418e16229c4ea8cfbb331dddbaa3c487736bd06d", "ja": "ん……そう、かな……。", "zh": "嗯……是、这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b1629b12fdfb9bc34ce74d817b89844285c92265add74954ab15f4f3564e6874", "ja": "杏奈、ゲームのイベント行ったとき、好きなキャラの\nコスプレイヤーさんと写真を撮ったよな？", "zh": "安娜，你去游戏活动的时候，和自己喜欢的角色的COSER拍过合影吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "b81ffc34553957f1b6c813526d8756833c3c4bdf3813ba704060adafff0473ca", "ja": "あ……うん……。杏奈、あの時は……\n大好きなキャラと、写真撮れて、嬉しかった……。", "zh": "啊……嗯……杏奈，那时候……\n能和最喜欢的角色一起拍照，真的很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dde0485740b57356ee3748b8408903e771ba28f4c87ff77be926e1e94f886a0c", "ja": "うん。今のお客さん、すごく嬉しそうだったし。\nあの時の杏奈と、同じ気持ちだったんだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。刚才那位客人看起来也特别开心。\n我想她当时的心情，肯定和那时候的杏奈一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "463c8a58f830f40aea29f977a084993593287cae42c49cabd4976d2d39d208e0", "ja": "そっか……。\nそれなら、よかった……です。", "zh": "这样啊……\n那就好……了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "e7fdb9db67d9fc87c11badd32d0e17ca3237a1ae3039b74bc00bfecfaac6f621", "ja": "じゃあ……えと……{$P$}さんも、\n杏奈と一緒に、写真……撮りたいって、思う……？", "zh": "那么……呃……{$P$}先生也想和杏奈一起拍照……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fa263e28ae5189f02d50ec2a507b91835ca22f21cc334c23fd5f786078e4f739", "ja": "俺か？　……そうだな。せっかく杏奈が\n一日メイドになってるんだし、撮ってみたいな。", "zh": "是我吗？……这个嘛，难得杏奈当一天女仆，我也想拍一张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "3a68ffb8813ab3da5403a8bff13766b532920cbecdb58db27c88b7eb799b4957", "ja": "ん……じゃあ、一緒に、撮ろ……？　\n休憩時間、もう少し……あるし……。", "zh": "嗯……那就一起拍……？休息时间……还剩一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "af21737768a4defd55ea11735fbec936e2b6f273a87ec367347d7d8547bde4d6", "ja": "杏奈も、今……{$P$}さんと、\n写真撮りたいって、思う……から……。", "zh": "因为杏奈现在也……想和{$P$}先生一起拍照……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0224_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "dd31fe0c9f0550bebd956a14a75746d2d9be56b5e32b7a259333a118f1deed48", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n杏奈にとって…SSR、です……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n对杏奈来说……是SSR……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
